[{"answer":"I've brought my notes on our Biology Field Trip to Rocky Bay, Colin,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-3-2023-06-04-16-51-55/1.mp3"},{"answer":"so we can work on our report on the research we did together.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-3-2023-06-04-16-51-55/2.mp3"},{"answer":"OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-3-2023-06-04-16-51-55/3.mp3"},{"answer":"I've got mine too. Let's look at the aims of the trip first.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-3-2023-06-04-16-51-55/4.mp3"},{"answer":"Right. What did you have?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-3-2023-06-04-16-51-55/5.mp3"},{"answer":"I just put something about getting experience of the different sorts of procedures used on a field trip.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-3-2023-06-04-16-51-55/6.mp3"},{"answer":"But we need something about what causes different organisms to choose particular habitats.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-3-2023-06-04-16-51-55/7.mp3"},{"answer":"I agree.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-3-2023-06-04-16-51-55/8.mp3"},{"answer":"And something about finding out how to protect organisms in danger of dying out?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-3-2023-06-04-16-51-55/9.mp3"},{"answer":"In our aims?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-3-2023-06-04-16-51-55/10.mp3"},{"answer":"But we weren't really looking at that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-3-2023-06-04-16-51-55/11.mp3"},{"answer":"I suppose not.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-3-2023-06-04-16-51-55/12.mp3"},{"answer":"OK, now there's the list of equipment we all had to bring on the field trip.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-3-2023-06-04-16-51-55/13.mp3"},{"answer":"What did they tell us to bring a ruler for?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-3-2023-06-04-16-51-55/14.mp3"},{"answer":"It was something about measuring the slope of the shore,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-3-2023-06-04-16-51-55/15.mp3"},{"answer":"but of course we didn't need it because we were measuring wind direction,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-3-2023-06-04-16-51-55/16.mp3"},{"answer":"and we'd brought the compass for that...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-3-2023-06-04-16-51-55/17.mp3"},{"answer":"But not the piece of string to hold up in the air!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-3-2023-06-04-16-51-55/18.mp3"},{"answer":"Didn't Mr Blake make a fuss about us leaving that behind.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-3-2023-06-04-16-51-55/19.mp3"},{"answer":"He does go on.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-3-2023-06-04-16-51-55/20.mp3"},{"answer":"Anyway it was easy to get one from another of the students.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-3-2023-06-04-16-51-55/21.mp3"},{"answer":"Now, the next section's the procedure.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-3-2023-06-04-16-51-55/22.mp3"},{"answer":"I sent you the draft of that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-3-2023-06-04-16-51-55/23.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah. And..","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-3-2023-06-04-16-51-55/24.mp3"},{"answer":"It was clear, but I don't think we need all these details of what time we left and what time we got back and...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-3-2023-06-04-16-51-55/25.mp3"},{"answer":"how we divided up the different research tasks.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-3-2023-06-04-16-51-55/26.mp3"},{"answer":"OK. I'll look at that again.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-3-2023-06-04-16-51-55/27.mp3"},{"answer":"Then we have to describe our method of investigation in detail.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-3-2023-06-04-16-51-55/28.mp3"},{"answer":"So let's begin with how we measured wave speed.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-3-2023-06-04-16-51-55/29.mp3"},{"answer":"I was surprised how straightforward that was.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-3-2023-06-04-16-51-55/30.mp3"},{"answer":"I'd expected us to have some sort of high-tech device,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-3-2023-06-04-16-51-55/31.mp3"},{"answer":"not just stand there and count the number of waves per minute.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-3-2023-06-04-16-51-55/32.mp3"},{"answer":"Not very precise, but I suppose it was good enough.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-3-2023-06-04-16-51-55/33.mp3"},{"answer":"But the way we measured the amount of salt was interesting.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-3-2023-06-04-16-51-55/34.mp3"},{"answer":"In the water from the rock pools?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-3-2023-06-04-16-51-55/35.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-3-2023-06-04-16-51-55/36.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, I wanted to check the chemicals we used in the lab when we analysed those samples -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-3-2023-06-04-16-51-55/37.mp3"},{"answer":"was it potassium chromate and silver nitrate?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-3-2023-06-04-16-51-55/38.mp3"},{"answer":"That's right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-3-2023-06-04-16-51-55/39.mp3"},{"answer":"OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-3-2023-06-04-16-51-55/40.mp3"},{"answer":"And we need the map of the seashore.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-3-2023-06-04-16-51-55/41.mp3"},{"answer":"You just left that to me.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-3-2023-06-04-16-51-55/42.mp3"},{"answer":"And I had to do it while the tide was low,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-3-2023-06-04-16-51-55/43.mp3"},{"answer":"well, that was OK, but the place I started it from was down on the beach,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-3-2023-06-04-16-51-55/44.mp3"},{"answer":"then I realised I should have gone up higher to get better visibility,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-3-2023-06-04-16-51-55/45.mp3"},{"answer":"so I had to start all over again.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-3-2023-06-04-16-51-55/46.mp3"},{"answer":"But at least I'd got the squared paper or I'd have had problems drawing it all to scale.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-3-2023-06-04-16-51-55/47.mp3"},{"answer":"It looks good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-3-2023-06-04-16-51-55/48.mp3"},{"answer":"We could get a map of the region off the internet and see if we need to make any changes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-3-2023-06-04-16-51-55/49.mp3"},{"answer":"I had a look but I couldn't find anything.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-3-2023-06-04-16-51-55/50.mp3"},{"answer":"But you took some pictures, didn't you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-3-2023-06-04-16-51-55/51.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah. I'll email you them if you want.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-3-2023-06-04-16-51-55/52.mp3"},{"answer":"OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-3-2023-06-04-16-51-55/53.mp3"},{"answer":"I'll make my amendments using those, then I can scan it into our report.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-3-2023-06-04-16-51-55/54.mp3"},{"answer":"Great.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-3-2023-06-04-16-51-55/55.mp3"},{"answer":"Now when we get to our findings I thought we could divide them up into the different zones we identified on the shore","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-3-2023-06-04-16-51-55/56.mp3"},{"answer":"and the problems organisms face in each zone.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-3-2023-06-04-16-51-55/57.mp3"},{"answer":"So for the highest area... ...the splash zone?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-3-2023-06-04-16-51-55/58.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, we found mostly those tiny shellfish that have strong hard shells that act as protection.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-3-2023-06-04-16-51-55/59.mp3"},{"answer":"But not from other organisms that might eat them, predators?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-3-2023-06-04-16-51-55/60.mp3"},{"answer":"No, that's not the main danger for them.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-3-2023-06-04-16-51-55/61.mp3"},{"answer":"But the shells prevent them from drying out","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-3-2023-06-04-16-51-55/62.mp3"},{"answer":"because they're in the open air for most of the time.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-3-2023-06-04-16-51-55/63.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-3-2023-06-04-16-51-55/64.mp3"},{"answer":"And since they're exposed, they need to be able to find some sort of shelter, or cover themselves up, so they don't get too hot.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-3-2023-06-04-16-51-55/65.mp3"},{"answer":"Then in the middle and lower zones, nearer the sea,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-3-2023-06-04-16-51-55/66.mp3"},{"answer":"we need to discuss the effects of wave action...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-3-2023-06-04-16-51-55/67.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, and how organisms develop structures to prevent themselves from being swept away,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-3-2023-06-04-16-51-55/68.mp3"},{"answer":"or even destroyed by being smashed against the rocks.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-3-2023-06-04-16-51-55/69.mp3"},{"answer":"I haven't done anything on the geological changes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-3-2023-06-04-16-51-55/70.mp3"},{"answer":"I don't know what to put for that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-3-2023-06-04-16-51-55/71.mp3"},{"answer":"No, we weren't concentrating on that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-3-2023-06-04-16-51-55/72.mp3"},{"answer":"Maybe we need to find some websites.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-3-2023-06-04-16-51-55/73.mp3"},{"answer":"Good idea.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-3-2023-06-04-16-51-55/74.mp3"},{"answer":"I've got the lecture notes from Mr Blake's geology course,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-3-2023-06-04-16-51-55/75.mp3"},{"answer":"but they're too general.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-3-2023-06-04-16-51-55/76.mp3"},{"answer":"But we could ask him which books on our Reading List might be most helpful.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-3-2023-06-04-16-51-55/77.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-3-2023-06-04-16-51-55/78.mp3"},{"answer":"OK, now I did a draft of the section of sources of possible error in our research,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-3-2023-06-04-16-51-55/79.mp3"},{"answer":"but I don't know if you agree.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-3-2023-06-04-16-51-55/80.mp3"},{"answer":"For example, the size of the sample, and whether it's big enough to make any general conclusions from.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-3-2023-06-04-16-51-55/81.mp3"},{"answer":"But I thought actually we did have quite a big sample.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-3-2023-06-04-16-51-55/82.mp3"},{"answer":"We did.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-3-2023-06-04-16-51-55/83.mp3"},{"answer":"And our general method of observation seemed quite reliable.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-3-2023-06-04-16-51-55/84.mp3"},{"answer":"But we might not be all that accurate as far as the actual numbers go.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-3-2023-06-04-16-51-55/85.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, we might have missed some organisms -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-3-2023-06-04-16-51-55/86.mp3"},{"answer":"if they were hiding under a rock, for example.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-3-2023-06-04-16-51-55/87.mp3"},{"answer":"I wasn't sure about the way we described their habitats.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-3-2023-06-04-16-51-55/88.mp3"},{"answer":"I decided it was probably OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-3-2023-06-04-16-51-55/89.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, and the descriptions we gave of the smaller organisms,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-3-2023-06-04-16-51-55/90.mp3"},{"answer":"they weren't very detailed, but they were adequate in this context.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-3-2023-06-04-16-51-55/91.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm not sure we identified all the species correctly though.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-3-2023-06-04-16-51-55/92.mp3"},{"answer":"OK, we'd better mention that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-3-2023-06-04-16-51-55/93.mp3"}]
